  "pages": 12
 },
 "summary": "A family of three-terminal linear regulators that turn a negative unregulated supply into a fixed negative rail of -5.0, -8.0, -12 or -15 V, the negative counterpart of the MC78M00 series. Current limiting, thermal shutdown and safe-area protection of the pass transistor are built in, and with enough heatsinking the output can exceed 0.5 A. The B grade is specified over TJ = -40 °C to 125 °C, the C grade over 0 °C to 125 °C; packages are TO-220 and DPAK. MC79M05BDTRKG is the -5.0 V, B-grade part in DPAK on a 2500-piece reel.",
